Done. Both files changed, verified 9/9 on the challenge validator (EXCELLENT).

**`app/auth.py`** — `require_api_key` now reads the `X-API-Key` header, returns 401 when missing or not in `VALID_API_KEYS`, otherwise returns the mapped username.

**`app/main.py`** — added to the existing pattern:
- `GET /tasks` takes optional `status`/`priority`/`assigned_to` filters (combinable) then slices by `page` (default 1) and `page_size` (default 20), both clamped `>= 1`.
- `POST /tasks` — auth via `Depends(require_api_key)`, 404 if `project_id` not in `projects`, ID generated as `max(existing) + 1` (survives deletes), returns the created task.
- `PUT /tasks/{task_id}` — auth, partial updates on the four fields (None = untouched), 404 if not found.
- `DELETE /tasks/{task_id}` — auth, removes from the list, 404 if not found.

